# Exhale Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env or .env.local to configure your local development environment.

# Optional: Google Gemini API Key for dynamic AI generation (Day Plan, Indoor Hacks, Swaps, Ask Exhale Chat).
# If not provided, Exhale automatically falls back to its built-in rule-based GenAI engine and sample data,
# ensuring 100% of the app remains fully functional and accessible offline.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Note for Production:
# For production deployments, never expose client-side API keys in browser bundles.
# Route Gemini API requests through a secure server-side proxy / edge function.
